  "description": "Private research university in St. Louis, Missouri. Its one genuinely public, institution-engineered API is CIViC, a cancer variant interpretation knowledgebase built by the McDonnell Genome Institute at the School of Medicine and served over GraphQL under CC0. WashU also operates its own Shibboleth SAML 2.0 identity provider published in InCommon, and runs a gated MuleSoft Anypoint enterprise API program. Its two OAI-PMH research repositories are Elsevier tenancies on wustl.edu hostnames, not WashU engineering.",
